<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da305441-c43a-4278-9bc1-d728f888755d> <https://schema.org/description> "The Marine Geological Samples Labroatory is part of the Graduate School of Oceanography at the University of Rhode Island Narragansett Bay Campus. We have over 15,000 deep-sea sediment cores, dredges, and deep submergence vehicle grabs from all over the world that are available for scientific research and education." .
