<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d15fbdb2-1752-49d6-97aa-aef95b28a2d4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d15fbdb2-1752-49d6-97aa-aef95b28a2d4> <https://schema.org/name> "Lund University Botanical Garden" .
