<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d15fbdb2-1752-49d6-97aa-aef95b28a2d4> <https://schema.org/description> "Lund University’s Botanical Garden’s living collection comprises over 6000 different plants, more than 5000 of which are a part of our databased collections used for teaching, research and conservation. Lund University Botanical Garden is a research infrastructure, and our ex situ collections are managed and curated with consideration to their scientific value." .
