<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/92065597-94dd-4f6e-b753-98a9dd153328> <https://schema.org/description> "Lycée Technique Agricole (LTA) is a leading vocational and technical high school in Luxembourg specializing in agriculture, environmental sciences, horticulture, and sustainable land management. The school combines practical training with academic education, preparing students for careers in agri-food industries, environmental sectors, and higher education pathways." .
