<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8f14845e-0b69-4e51-8006-c0e562aa4eb9> <https://schema.org/description> "Mycotheca (MYCL) is an independent fungarium created to provide fungal specimens and open data to the scientific community. It emerged from the need to document and preserve Chilean funga but also to guarantee access to the information generated in the process. Each record in the database follows the guidelines of the Darwin Core standard in line with the FAIR principles. This project is not affiliated with any government or academic institution and is funded entirely by voluntary contributions from Patreon members." .
