<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/9fc59465-f8fd-4aff-b181-fc0bdb9afda2> <https://schema.org/description> "OPHIS is an active research facility in herpetology and paleontology. The museum-laboratory is located in Teramo (TE), Abruzzo. The facility, inaugurated in May 2022, offers guided tours for an educational and informative journey through Mesozoic and modern reptiles." .
