<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e37637cb-c83a-4e72-9201-340267710328> <https://schema.org/description> "Established on 15th May 1992, with only a single faculty at the Nyankpala campus, the University for Development Studies (UDS) is Ghana's first public university in the North with the aim to provide quality higher education, undertake research and to blend the academic world with that of the community." .
