<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fd115395-48fd-4f35-94fc-ceef73b2a5f8> <https://schema.org/name> "Wildlife Preservation Canada" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fd115395-48fd-4f35-94fc-ceef73b2a5f8> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "WPC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fd115395-48fd-4f35-94fc-ceef73b2a5f8> <https://schema.org/description> "Wildlife Preservation Canada (WPC) is the last defence for endangered species in the country. For nearly four decades, we’ve provided direct, hands-on care for reptiles, amphibians, birds, insects and mammals on the brink of extinction." .
