<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/49662768-ac3c-4072-bdc5-fae193218ab2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/49662768-ac3c-4072-bdc5-fae193218ab2> <https://schema.org/name> "University of Santo Tomas - Herpetological Research Collection" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/49662768-ac3c-4072-bdc5-fae193218ab2> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "USTHRC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/49662768-ac3c-4072-bdc5-fae193218ab2> <https://schema.org/description> "The University of Santo Tomas - Herpetological Research Collection (UST-HRC) is a specialized repository in Manila, Philippines, focused on preserving, documenting, and studying Philippine reptiles and amphibians. The collection acts as a vital resource for biodiversity research, recently hosting the 2nd Philippine Herpetology Symposium in November 2025 to promote conservation and new discoveries in the field." .
