<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/07d05fc9-3ee2-464f-8c13-2b3ded8d2fa1> <https://schema.org/description> "This is a collection of bee specimens for various government, university, and NGO projects around the world. Specimens are sent for identification and most are kept at this institution temporarily and returned to the institution that collected them or deposited at the US National Pollinating Insects Collection (USNPIC/BBSL). A reference collection of under 10,000 specimens is housed here permanently." .
