<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8d0de69b-8d45-41e0-8dfd-73c009b5a502> <https://schema.org/name> "Parque da Ciência Newton Freire Maia" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8d0de69b-8d45-41e0-8dfd-73c009b5a502> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "IRAI" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8d0de69b-8d45-41e0-8dfd-73c009b5a502> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Jun 2012. The Herbarium is a unit of Newton Freire Maia Park (Parque Newton Freire Maia), a science center aiming the public understanding of science. For this reason, the herbarium is considered a teaching herbarium that develops scientific education programs of for students and teachers. Specimens collected in the Irai Ambiental Protection Area and in the Afonso Pena International Airport, both located in the metropolitan region of Curitiba, PR, Brazil. The herbarium also contains duplicates from other brazilian iherbaria. The scientific collection is properly cataloged and identified by specialists of the Botanical Museum of Curitiba (Museu Botânico Municipal de Curitiba)." .
