<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/9b90bc21-f704-4c92-8f17-c66ea53219e5> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Feb 2012. Flora of Murmansk Province; Russian Far East; Karelia; Siberia; North America; western Europe. The herbarium contains vascular plants (ca. 60 000 sheets including ca. 9000 duplicates); bryophytes (ca. 46 000 specimens including 5000 duplicates); ca. 34000 lichens (including 4000 duplicates) and ca. 1200 cyanoprokaryota. The hepatic herbarium is worldwide, with emphasis on the territory of Russia." .
