<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fca66e48-cb7b-4acc-b0e1-2367bc369963> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fca66e48-cb7b-4acc-b0e1-2367bc369963> <https://schema.org/name> "Fundación Jardín Botánico Joaquín Antonio Uribe de Medellín" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fca66e48-cb7b-4acc-b0e1-2367bc369963> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "JAUM" .
