<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/56fe6bb4-30b0-4b10-b25b-cc8211502f9b> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "EAFM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/56fe6bb4-30b0-4b10-b25b-cc8211502f9b> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Dec 2011. The Campus has about 164 hectares of Amazon forest available for collecting for all researchers. The EAFM Herbarium has one lodging (with four beds, air-conditioner, and refrigerator) where botanists may staff gratis. - EAFM Herbarium is placed about 7 Km from INPA Herbarium. Plants of the Americas, especially Amazonia" .
