<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e6163552-6899-4690-883b-5ffa0aaf2433> <https://schema.org/description> "Bangladesh National Herbarium (BNH) is a national research organization for plant taxonomic research and museum of dried plant specimens. BNH is an attached department under the Ministry of Environment and Forests. It deals with the exploration, collection, identification, preservation of plants and floristic publication of the country. During floristic explorations work, scientists of BNH collects fertile plant specimens including all sorts of associated information (viz. place of collection, local name, date of collection, phenology, diversity, abundance, distribution, local uses, potential risk) from all over the country. Bangladesh, especially vascular plants." .
