<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eb2e8ddd-937a-4d18-8b7a-b1cdad037a26> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Oct 2012. More information about collectors represented in GAP: Dominique CHAIX (1730-1799) or Reliquae Chaixianae, Baptiste BLANC (1840-1890) & brothers Auguste BURLE (1835-1889) and Emile BURLE (1834-1875), VANT (18e), Joseph Pierre Guillaume BRUN (19e), unknown man (18e), C. H. REPELLIN, Pierre Paul GUILLAUME (1808-1889), Joséphin Hilarion BOREL (1836-1902) or Herbarium Musaei Vapincensis, Adolphe Etienne PELLAT (1825-1912), Jean-Denis LONG (1776-1866), Joseph Louis Claude COLAUD de la SALCETTE (1758-1832), Edouard CHAS (20e), Raymond BONNARDON, Joseph-Louis-Marie SANDRE (1856-1922) & Jean-Joseph BOREL (1787-1883), Paul CARRIÉ (20e), Horace Antoine Marie BUSQUET (1839-1931) & A. BUSQUET, Dorothée MEYER (20e), Jean-Pierre DALMAS (20e), Louis AMANDIER (20e) & Jacques GASQUEZ (20e), Pierre FONTANEL (20e), Nicole JULLIARD (20e), botanists of Conservatoire Botanique National Alpin, herbarium of bryophytes (cbna). Alpine and Mediterranean flora of southeastern France." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eb2e8ddd-937a-4d18-8b7a-b1cdad037a26> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q2994479> .
