<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/190b20c5-1d47-4858-af23-5ec6093702b9> <https://schema.org/description> "Specialty: Vascular plants of Hong Kong and southern China; ascomycetes and hyphomycetes of southeastern Asia and Australasia. Approximately 6,000 specimens (c. 1,500 fungi, 700 ferns and 3,800 seed plants). Vascular plants of Hong Kong and southern China; ascomycetes and hyphomycetes of southeastern Asia and Australasia." .
