<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2b1afcd0-04ee-4940-bd44-64438d74e6b3> <https://schema.org/name> "Istituto di Scienze delle Produzioni alimentari di Bari" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2b1afcd0-04ee-4940-bd44-64438d74e6b3> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CNR-ISPA-BA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2b1afcd0-04ee-4940-bd44-64438d74e6b3> <https://schema.org/description> "The Institute of Food Production Sciences (ISPA-CNR) is a reality of excellence, recognized internationally, which operates in the sector of research, innovation and technological transfer for the improvement of the quality and safety of agri-food products. ISPA-CNR, by carrying out synergistic actions between scientific research and production with the transfer of scientific acquisitions, supports technological innovation paths of small, medium and large national and foreign companies in the agri-food sector. In particular, in the field of food safety, projects are underway in which innovative methodologies are developed for the determination of mycotoxins, toxigenic fungi, pathogenic microorganisms, and allergens in raw materials and foods, such as cereals, wine, pasta, milk, food for childhood and dried fruit." .
