<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e92418b-5e26-485c-912c-c41263d9c581> <https://schema.org/name> "Museum of Evolution, Uppsala University" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e92418b-5e26-485c-912c-c41263d9c581> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UPS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e92418b-5e26-485c-912c-c41263d9c581> <https://schema.org/description> "Funded by Carl von Linnaeus in 1743 as ‘Museum Naturalium Academiae Upsaliensis’. 'Evolutionsmuseeet' (= The Museum of Evolution) was created in 1999 by merging the Institute of Botany, the Institute of Zoology, the Institute of Entomology and the Institute of Paleontology, and their respective collections. In addition, a collection of mineralogy was added from the Institute of Geology." .
