<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35bb26b8-f1de-462c-b167-fd4edefe1f84> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ZMSU" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35bb26b8-f1de-462c-b167-fd4edefe1f84> <https://schema.org/description> "Natural history museum focusing on the fauna of the Volga Basin and Ural Region and adjacent territories; founded in 1909; collection ca. 20,000 specimens." .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/393d77c0-c090-4d9c-b753-e7d0813472e7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
