<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/72e2c347-2e66-4ae8-a151-f5faffa6cfdc> <https://schema.org/description> "The repository of our research units collects, processes, stores, and distributes samples of mollusk or fish edible from Mediterranean area to support future scientific investigation. The collection operation has two phases: first species identification by morphological characteristic and second recording each specimen by a unambiguous code. The processing and storage operations: every specimen is quickly frozen before the molecular biology analysis. After analysis a quote of muscle tissue is dehydrated in alcohol and storage in freezer." .

