<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/87983748-1c5a-4a92-b9ea-9eeda92e6d3f> <https://schema.org/name> "University of Texas at Austin, The Culture Collection of Algae" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/87983748-1c5a-4a92-b9ea-9eeda92e6d3f> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UTEX" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/87983748-1c5a-4a92-b9ea-9eeda92e6d3f> <https://schema.org/description> "The Culture Collection includes approximately 3,000 different strains of living algae, representing most major algal taxa. The primary function of UTEX is to provide algal cultures at modest cost to a user community. Cultures in the Collection are used for research, teaching, biotechnology development, and various other projects throughout the world. Most of the strains are kept under a numerical order system that require no prefixes, but there are four collections that use the prefixes SP, EE, FD, and SNO." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/87983748-1c5a-4a92-b9ea-9eeda92e6d3f> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(-97.7383 30.2875)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

