<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dc24b0d-c322-4174-b402-b18af0f524fa> <https://schema.org/name> "Plant Virus GenBank" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dc24b0d-c322-4174-b402-b18af0f524fa> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PVGB" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dc24b0d-c322-4174-b402-b18af0f524fa> <https://schema.org/description> "Plant Virus GenBank retains a number of accessions and a wide range of collections of Plant Virus Biomaterials useful for Plant Virology and Biotech Research. PVGB has been established on April in 1999 located in Seoul Women's University, Seoul, Korea. PVGB has been recognized as a member of World Federation for Culture Collection & World Data Center for Microorganisms (WFCC-WDCM) since April of 2001." .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/9384011e-4d9b-4488-a5dd-5cb67a3c17f7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/9384011e-4d9b-4488-a5dd-5cb67a3c17f7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
