<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ccb5609a-65b7-4123-a93e-003d6d2694fa> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "WAVA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ccb5609a-65b7-4123-a93e-003d6d2694fa> <https://schema.org/description> "The Waterborne Virus Bank has been established to identify waterborne viruses that are likely to cause viral outbreaks through domestic water supplies, provide an impetus to viral diagnosis using molecular and immunological analyses, and help researchers across Korean research institutions." .

