<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dcc50723-f94f-4527-ad5a-2aa97dde82bf> <https://schema.org/description> "Specialty: Cameroon phanerogams, pteridophytes, and some bryophytes.Inst. type: State institution, Ministere de la Recherche Scientifique and Technique (MINREST)|Additional Correspondents: Gaston Achoundong, Chief, gachoundong@yahoo.fr|IH upload June 2010. Cameroon phanerogams, pteridophytes, and some bryophytes." .
