<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e07d219d-b80d-4bda-9e45-88123ddc94ba> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Nov 2011. (staff changes). Herbarium News published approximately three times/year (e-mail subscriptions welcomed); issues available for consultation at http://www.herbarium.rdg.ac.uk/. Herbarium collections presently being entered in BRAHMS, accessible via www. Current projects include Euro+Med Plant Base, ILDIS (International Legume Database and Information Service; http://www.ildis.org/), Species 2000 (http://www.sp2000.org/), and Moroccan floristic catalogues. Other web addresses: http://www.reading.ac.uk/AcaDepts/sb. Europe, especially Great Britain and Ireland; Iberian Peninsula; northern Africa (especially Morocco); Macaronesia; Middle East; cool temperate South America; worldwide pteridophytes and bryophytes; lichens of British Isles, Europe, and Morocco." .
