<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f1cc851c-8713-4ec9-893f-f1fa78ce451a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f1cc851c-8713-4ec9-893f-f1fa78ce451a> <https://schema.org/name> "Parasite Resource Bank" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f1cc851c-8713-4ec9-893f-f1fa78ce451a> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PRB" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f1cc851c-8713-4ec9-893f-f1fa78ce451a> <https://schema.org/description> "Parasites resource Bank(PRB) has been established in 2005 as a branch of Korean National Research Resources Bank. PRB provides biological products, conducts research in parasitology. Develops useful biological materials and information and technical services to government, private industries and academic organizations. Our mission is for collection, authenticating, preserving, developing and distributing biological materials, information and standards for the advancement and validating of scientific materials as well as providing technical supports. We use a single numbering system for all specimens." .

