<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/face22d5-3603-40f0-947c-46a9f5368518> <https://schema.org/description> "NIOMR was established by the Federal Government of Nigeria to conduct research in the following areas of Science: 1.Genetic improvement of marine and brackish water living resources in Nigeria bracket and marina waters. 2.Studies of abundance, distribution and biology of aquatic resources in Nigeria brackish and marine waters.3.Establishment of the physical and chemical characteristics of Nigerian territorial waters.4.Determination of the effects of pollution of Nigerian Coastal waters and its prevention.5.Extension Research and Liaison Services in these areas mandate. Nigerian Coastal waters. Atlantic marine resources" .
