<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0cfc95dc-3461-40d0-9bcf-84e1a75a9fee> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "BYU" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0cfc95dc-3461-40d0-9bcf-84e1a75a9fee> <https://schema.org/description> "Herbarium uses BRY institution code, other collections use BYU. BYU specimens include 42,000 Herps, 2 million+ arthropods, ~11,000 birds, 100,000+ fishes, 40,000+ mammals, ~43,000 mollusks." .
