<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/18558850-091c-422e-8c58-ad065389a14c> <https://schema.org/description> "Research specimens from various taxonomic groups including approximately 115 thousand plants, 13 thousand fishes, two thousand birds, and five thousand invertebrates (cnidarians, annelids, mollusks, arthropods and echinoderms). Among them, the fish collection, which covers extensive local fish fauna, is the most comprehensive collection of its kind in Taiwan and adjacent areas." .
