<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/316a147d-49ad-440b-90fc-e46845e044d6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/316a147d-49ad-440b-90fc-e46845e044d6> <https://schema.org/name> "Centre International de Ressources Microbiennes" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/316a147d-49ad-440b-90fc-e46845e044d6> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CIRM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/316a147d-49ad-440b-90fc-e46845e044d6> <https://schema.org/description> "CIRM is a network of Biological Resource Centres created by INRA and several partners as a network to host its collections of microorganisms. CIRM preserves over 22.000 isolates of plant associated bacteria, pathogenic bacteria, food bacteria, agro-food yeasts and filamentous fungi." .

