<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3c43d061-aaab-41a4-8237-1e229ad8fb83> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "BMNAS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3c43d061-aaab-41a4-8237-1e229ad8fb83> <https://schema.org/description> "Various modified nucleosides will be synthesized. Through these synthetic technique, functional oligonucleotide such as cell membrane permeable siRNA and fluorescent oligonucleotide possible to applicable to SNP probe or mRNA sensor also will be synthesized. With these synthetic materials, the bank of modified nucleic acid systems will play an essential role for widespread use of these materials." .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/40eea2ae-cba4-4d17-ad7f-766bcf0193dc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
