<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7b6590f0-c03f-409b-ae28-f443c1166d23> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7b6590f0-c03f-409b-ae28-f443c1166d23> <https://schema.org/name> "Kagoshima University" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7b6590f0-c03f-409b-ae28-f443c1166d23> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "KAG" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7b6590f0-c03f-409b-ae28-f443c1166d23> <https://schema.org/description> "Specialty: Vascular plants of Kagoshima Prefecture, including mainland and islands; vascular plants of southern Japan, from southern Kyushu to the Nansei Islands. KAGS (30 000 specimens) incorporated into KAG in 2002. Vascular plants of Kagoshima Prefecture, including mainland and islands; vascular plants of southern Japan, from southern Kyushu to the Nansei Islands." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7b6590f0-c03f-409b-ae28-f443c1166d23> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <https://ror.org/03ss88z23> .
