<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ca3714ed-d1af-485e-97ff-5f19be667b29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ca3714ed-d1af-485e-97ff-5f19be667b29> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
