<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d56badc1-4729-449e-8d30-8b75fe1439a3> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Nov 2011 (new Curator/Correspondent). NEBC integrated into the Harvard University Herbaria, but NEBC should continue to be cited. Loans processed through requests to Harvard University Herbaria. Separate request to NEBC unnecessary. The 253 000 specimens in NEBC are included in the total given for the Harvard University Herbaria (listed under GH). New England" .
