<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e26df85f-d42e-43ec-9fff-453a6212a45c> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Feb 2010. FH is housed separately from A, AMES, GH, and ECON, but all information regarding FH is included with the Harvard University Herbaria. Specimens from Farlow Herbarium should be cited as FH. The 1 319 000 specimens in FH are included in the total given for the Harvard University Herbaria (listed under GH). A, AMES, ECON, FH, and GH are administered as one unit. See GH entry for more detailed information." .
