<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f6605012-e426-4b20-911f-ad45b380249d> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Mar 2013 (email address change for corresponded). 134 000-piece historical collection of nursery and seed catalogs. 30 000-volume botanical and horticultural library. Large collection of liquid-preserved palm material (fruits, flowers, and woody parts) and anatomical slides. Photographs of palm types of O. Beccari, C. F. P. von Martius, R. Spruce, and J. W. H. Trail. Seed reference collection for northeastern U.S. C. H. Muller oak collection. A. LeRoy Andrews bryophyte collection. Cultivated flora of U.S. and tropics; New York; northeastern U.S.; Japan; worldwide Arecaceae; Cucurbitaceae; Malvaceae; Fagaceae; Fabaceae; gymnosperms; bryophytes" .
