<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/cf789a88-fb94-44db-bf86-d1119fe42187> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/cf789a88-fb94-44db-bf86-d1119fe42187> <https://schema.org/name> "Canadian Institute of Ecology and Evolution" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/cf789a88-fb94-44db-bf86-d1119fe42187> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CIEE" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/cf789a88-fb94-44db-bf86-d1119fe42187> <https://schema.org/description> "CIEE is a Canada wide interuniversity network for ecology and evolution focusing on data synthesis and training. Through projects such as the Living Data Project, we support rescue of endangered datasets, including ones of biodiversity. More information can be found at our website." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/cf789a88-fb94-44db-bf86-d1119fe42187> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(-123.250865 49.263143)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
