<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <https://schema.org/name> "The Ark Nature Centre" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ARKNC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <https://schema.org/description> "The Ark Nature Centre is a natural science museum founded in 2000, located in the center of Pori. In addition to public spaces, The Ark Nature Centre preserves natural history collections. Most of the natural history collections of The Ark Nature Centre are from Satakunta. The collections include taxidermy, pressed plants, beetles, bird nests and eggs, as well as the butterfly collections of Viljo Lauro and Pori Lyceum." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a4ac23bb-e931-44cf-8855-a117be9b710f> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(21.79118 61.48647)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
