<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <https://schema.org/name> "Regional Museum of Lapland" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "LMM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <https://schema.org/description> "The Regional Museum of Lapland is a museum with regional responsibility for the province of Lapland, excluding the Tornio River Valley, the Kemi region and the Sámi homeland in cultural environmental tasks. The museum’s collections of objects, photographs, archives and natural history material are available to researchers and other interested parties." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743482-811b-4b5e-8737-87330ca5a738> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(25.72599 66.50757)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
