<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0c9d83f4-b8ff-47a7-9e02-2799b788a63b> <https://schema.org/name> "Sree Narayana College Herbarium" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0c9d83f4-b8ff-47a7-9e02-2799b788a63b> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SNCH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0c9d83f4-b8ff-47a7-9e02-2799b788a63b> <https://schema.org/description> "Sree Narayana College Herbarium (acronym SNCH), one of the pioneer herbaria of South India, is attached to the Post Graduate & Research Department of Botany, Sree Narayana College Kollam, which was established in 1949. Completely digitalised, SNCH is a member of the Society of Herbarium Curators (SHC) and has been acknowledged by the International Herbarium Index. SNCH is the 5th largest herbarium in the state of Kerala, India." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0c9d83f4-b8ff-47a7-9e02-2799b788a63b> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(76.601979 8.881894)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
