<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d2b8160a-ffa8-4f85-8b1a-53c302adaf27> <https://schema.org/name> "TB Lee herbarium" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d2b8160a-ffa8-4f85-8b1a-53c302adaf27> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SNUA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d2b8160a-ffa8-4f85-8b1a-53c302adaf27> <https://schema.org/description> "The T.B. Lee Herbarium is a part of the Arboretum of the College of Agriculture and Life Sciences at Seoul National University, and when the college moved to the Gwanak Campus in 2003, it was renamed in honor of the late Professor Changbok Lee, borrowing his family name and the national name of the T.B. Lee Herbarium. The T.B. Lee herbarium was initially a small facility within the Department of Forestry (now the Department of Forest Science), but when the Arboretum was established in 1969, it became part of the Arboretum, where it has remained ever since." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d2b8160a-ffa8-4f85-8b1a-53c302adaf27> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(126.948676 37.457469)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

