<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35d2e89f-9f26-4ad2-b37a-ab26ee29aca0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35d2e89f-9f26-4ad2-b37a-ab26ee29aca0> <https://schema.org/name> "National Botanical Garden" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35d2e89f-9f26-4ad2-b37a-ab26ee29aca0> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "NBG-BFD" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35d2e89f-9f26-4ad2-b37a-ab26ee29aca0> <https://schema.org/description> "The National Botanical Garden, located in Mirpur, Dhaka, is the largest plant conservation center in Bangladesh, covering an extensive area of approximately 84 hectares (210 acres). Established in 1961, it serves as a vital hub for plant conservation, botanical research, environmental education, and public recreation. Managed by the Forest Department under the Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change, the garden plays a significant role in preserving the country's floral biodiversity. The garden is thoughtfully divided into 57 distinct sections, each curated to showcase diverse plant species and ecosystems. It is home to around 56,000 individual trees, shrubs, and herbs, including a rich assortment of aquatic plants, medicinal herbs, and ornamental species. To support the conservation of rare and endangered species, the garden features a modern vegetative propagation center and a tissue culture laboratory, currently focusing on orchids and other threatened flora. " .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/35d2e89f-9f26-4ad2-b37a-ab26ee29aca0> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(90.347627 23.812747)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d8a302b5-435c-4a70-bc5d-48c00ea1c590> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d8a302b5-435c-4a70-bc5d-48c00ea1c590> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d8a302b5-435c-4a70-bc5d-48c00ea1c590> <https://schema.org/name> "Tribhuvan Multiple Campus" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d8a302b5-435c-4a70-bc5d-48c00ea1c590> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "TMCTU" .
