<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e2ecdfc7-5de4-44e5-b0a7-7b6bb1e9557c> <https://schema.org/description> "he UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology is a world-leading independent research institute, carrying out excellent environmental science with impact. The Predatory Bird Monitoring Scheme holds a tissue archive of samples collected from UK native raptors and owls." .
