<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3d5c3b16-dc8d-4f0d-b6c2-dc67eb6eea1b> <https://schema.org/description> "Bioresources Development and Conservative Program (BDCP) is a registered international not-for-profit, non-governmental knowledge based organization founded in 1992 to promote and encourage community based sustainable development that encompasses the interface between health and the environment." .
