<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1d4fc5e2-4cce-4afc-a565-997f9b3c47b7> <https://schema.org/description> "Established in 1964 after the name of Saint Stephen, the college is the fulfillment of a long-cherished desire of its founder, His Grace Mar Thoma Dionysius, Metropolitan of Niranam Diocese of the Malankara Orthodox Church. The College, affiliated to the University of Kerala, offers undergraduate programs in Botany, Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics, Zoology, Economics, English and Commerce and postgraduate programs in Botany, Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics and Zoology. The department of Zoology and Chemistry are recognized as Research Centers under the University of Kerala." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1d4fc5e2-4cce-4afc-a565-997f9b3c47b7> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(76.816608 9.091271)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
