<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/264ad4f4-6232-4fc0-8526-91df3d9514cc> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "OKCZOO" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/264ad4f4-6232-4fc0-8526-91df3d9514cc> <https://schema.org/description> "Discover the wonders of wildlife and wild places at the Oklahoma City Zoo and Botanical Garden, Oklahoma's largest and most popular cultural attraction. Featuring world-class habitats including Expedition Africa, Sanctuary Asia, Great EscApe, Cat Forest/Lion Overlook and Oklahoma Trails. As a leader in conservation, the OKC Zoo is working to save the natural world through crucial programs, scientific research, and education to inspire people to take action to protect wildlife and wild places. " .
