<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ab50de57-b6a9-484e-9469-09e97972fc28> <https://schema.org/name> "Istituto di ricerca sulle acque di Brugherio" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ab50de57-b6a9-484e-9469-09e97972fc28> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CNR-IRSA-MI" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ab50de57-b6a9-484e-9469-09e97972fc28> <https://schema.org/description> "The CNR-IRSA headquarters in Brugherio specialises in freshwater ecosystems, studying their biomolecular, chemical and biological aspects. Research focuses on river ecology, integrating experimental and modelling approaches to assess water quality. Key areas of study include anthropogenic impacts such as water pollution, hydromorphological changes, deposition of atmospheric pollutants and global climate change. In addition, biodiversity and macrobenthic community research play an important role in the institution's activities." .
