<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f4b2bcde-f453-4477-8b99-c384890019cf> <https://schema.org/name> "Regional Ayurveda Research Institute (under CCRAS, Ministry of AYUSH, Govt. of India), Sri Vijayapuram" .
