<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f4b2bcde-f453-4477-8b99-c384890019cf> <https://schema.org/description> "Regional Ayurveda Research Institute, Sri Vijaya Puram is a peripheral unit under Central Council for Research in Ayurvedic Sciences, Ministry of AYUSH, Govt. of India, New Delhi functioning at Chakkargaon, Sri Vijaya Puram (formerly Port Blair). At present the unit is undertaking, co-ordinating, aiding and promoting research in Ayurvedic science with special emphasis on Tribal Health Care Research. Besides, the institute is involved in Medico-Ethno Botanical survey and collection of raw drugs and museum specimens." .
