<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fda83cba-1d6c-4a49-8450-6bc152010c47> <https://schema.org/name> "University of Zagreb, Faculty of Science, Division of Zoology" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fda83cba-1d6c-4a49-8450-6bc152010c47> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UZFS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fda83cba-1d6c-4a49-8450-6bc152010c47> <https://schema.org/description> "Faculty of Science, University of Zagreb, offers undergraduate, graduate, and postgraduate study programs, and conducts research in natural sciences and mathematics. It comprises seven departments - biology, physics, chemistry, mathematics, geophysics, geography, and geology. Division of Zoology, Biology Department, holds valuable zoological collections, dating back to 1874, including educational, entomological, and small mammal collections." .
