<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/6b5e031e-7fd9-4c56-9887-a27e2d2de3da> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "FJTCM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/6b5e031e-7fd9-4c56-9887-a27e2d2de3da> <https://schema.org/description> "(Google translated) The college owns the National Development and Reform Commission Fujian and Taishi Chinese Medicine Molecular Biotechnology National Local Joint Engineering Research Center, the State Administration of Traditional Chinese Medicine The Provincial Traditional Chinese Medicine Materials Monitoring Technology Service Center, the Provincial Traditional Chinese Medicine Processing Base of the State Administration of Traditional Chinese Medicine Medicine Administration Traditional Chinese Medicine Pharmacology/Cell Biology/Chinese Medicine Biological Pharmacy Level 3 Laboratory, Fujian Provincial Traditional Chinese Medicine Key Laboratory, Fujian Provincial Traditional Chinese Medicine Industry Technology Development Base, Fujian Traditional Chinese Medicine Preparation and Quality Control Engineering Technology Research Center, Fujian Provincial Chinese Medicine Clinical Clinical Clinic Previous research and quality control engineering technology research centers, Fujian and Taiwan specialty medicinal materials industrialization technology collaborative innovation centers, Fujian -Taiwan Chinese medicine research and development technology platform, Fujian traditional Chinese medicine resources research and development and utilization of key laboratories in Fujian Province." .
