<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae923403-c3c0-460e-a193-b932ec9d7e10> <https://schema.org/description> "The research activities at CNR-ISA are aimed at evaluating food quality and safety and investigating the relationships between food and health. Technology transfer is an important part of the CNR-ISA mission." .
