<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fdac8c73-e90a-4bc1-8456-ace8f9e462b4> <https://schema.org/name> "Smithsonian Gabon Biodiversity Program" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fdac8c73-e90a-4bc1-8456-ace8f9e462b4> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SGBP" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fdac8c73-e90a-4bc1-8456-ace8f9e462b4> <https://schema.org/description> "Researchers from the Smithsonian Conservation Biology Institute, in collaboration with Gabonese scientists, are studying the biological diversity of the Gamba Complex of Protected Areas. Studies under the Gabon Biodiversity Program, a partnership with an oil company, consisted of biological assessments of select plant, vertebrate, and invertebrate taxonomic groups." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fdac8c73-e90a-4bc1-8456-ace8f9e462b4> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(10.018891 -2.723149)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59f9ebda-4d4e-4e40-9c47-678e6a8b936b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59f9ebda-4d4e-4e40-9c47-678e6a8b936b> <https://schema.org/name> "Institut de Recherches Agronomiques et Forestières (IRAF)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59f9ebda-4d4e-4e40-9c47-678e6a8b936b> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "IRAF" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59f9ebda-4d4e-4e40-9c47-678e6a8b936b> <https://schema.org/description> "The Institut de Recherches Agronomiques et Forestières (IRAF) in Gabon was established following the nationalization of scientific research in Gabon. It is one of the five institutes grouped within the National Center for Scientific and Technological Research (CENAREST). As a public institution, IRAF operates under the triple supervision of the Ministry of Higher Education and Scientific Research, the Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, and Rural Development, and the Ministry of Water and Forests. The Institut de Recherches Agronomiques et Forestières (IRAF) in Gabon hosts the Aquatic Ecosystem Biodiversity Program. This program focuses on studying and conserving the biodiversity of aquatic ecosystems, including rivers, lakes, and wetlands." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59f9ebda-4d4e-4e40-9c47-678e6a8b936b> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(9.490131 0.418195)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

