<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/26afa003-ec77-4c47-9732-48ec1fa5b90f> <https://schema.org/description> "SBR is the largest nature reserve in Lebanon and the southern part of the Mediterranean. It covers an area of 500 sq. km (50,000 hectares), or 5% of the Lebanese territory, at an altitudinal gradient between 800 and 1900 m above sea level. Shouf Biosphere Reserve, Lebanon. Plants" .
