<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3b2368c7-c09e-4772-bd71-da9e52c4f2ac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3b2368c7-c09e-4772-bd71-da9e52c4f2ac> <https://schema.org/name> "Institute of Zoology of the Ministry of Science and Education of the Republic of Azerbaijan" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3b2368c7-c09e-4772-bd71-da9e52c4f2ac> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "IZANAS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3b2368c7-c09e-4772-bd71-da9e52c4f2ac> <https://schema.org/description> "In 1936, the Azerbaijan department of the Transcaucasian branch of the Academy of Sciences of the USSR was renamed as independent Azerbaijan branch of Academy of Sciences of the USSR. By order of the Presidium of the Azerbaijan branch of the USSR on the basis of zoological department on March 1, 1936 was established the Institute of Zoology of the Azerbaijan Academy of Sciences." .
