<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/daa03cee-3a66-4af7-8e11-be591687bcc3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/daa03cee-3a66-4af7-8e11-be591687bcc3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/daa03cee-3a66-4af7-8e11-be591687bcc3> <https://schema.org/name> "Faculty of Agriculture and Food Sciences, University of Sarajevo" .
