<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1e1c5aa4-ef3b-4ac8-a83e-fcbb5d6135e3> <https://schema.org/name> "NGO Suvad and Mirzeta Lelo Museum" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1e1c5aa4-ef3b-4ac8-a83e-fcbb5d6135e3> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "Lelo" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1e1c5aa4-ef3b-4ac8-a83e-fcbb5d6135e3> <https://schema.org/description> "Formerly, known as the Association for inventarisation and protection of animals. More details could be found in the following [publication](https://www.researchgate.net/publication/378288930_20_godina_postojanja_nevladine_organizacije_Udruzenje_za_inventarizaciju_i_zastitu_zivotinja_Ilijas). Bosnia and Herzegovina. animals, mostly insects" .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dc16bee4-b757-4ff5-8b7c-91999948947d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dc16bee4-b757-4ff5-8b7c-91999948947d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dc16bee4-b757-4ff5-8b7c-91999948947d> <https://schema.org/name> "Faculty of Science and Mathematics, University of Tuzla" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dc16bee4-b757-4ff5-8b7c-91999948947d> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PMF_UNTZ" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/dc16bee4-b757-4ff5-8b7c-91999948947d> <https://schema.org/description> "The Faculty of Science and Mathematics in Tuzla was founded in 2002 as a higher education institution created by separating the study departments of natural sciences and mathematics from the Faculty of Philosophy in Tuzla. Immediately after its foundation, the Faculty was located in the renovated building of the former student dormitory \"Enver Šiljak\", in Univerzitetska Street no. 4. The faculty has the following laboratories: Department of Biology: Laboratory for botany and plant ecology, Laboratory for zoology and animal ecology, Laboratory for physiology, Laboratory for microbiology, Laboratory for genetics, Scientific - research laboratory. Department of Chemistry: Laboratory for Chemistry and Biochemistry, Laboratory for General and Inorganic Chemistry, Laboratory for Organic Chemistry, Scientific and Research Laboratory for Chemistry (located on the Campus of the University of Tuzla). Department of Physics: Laboratory for Solid State Physics, LDDZZ: Laboratory for Detection, Dosimetry and Radiation Protection, Laboratory for General Physics, Laboratory for Biophysics. Department of Geography: Laboratory for Geographic Information System (GIS), at PMF with 11 computers. Department of Mathematics: two computer centers, located in the classrooms at PMF, with 22 computers with continuous Internet access available to PMF students. In total, over 100 members of the teaching staff and assistants, including external collaborators, are employed at the faculty." .
