<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae7859c7-4602-434a-9b84-d5ee26703b97> <https://schema.org/name> "Department of Bioinformatics and Genetics - Swedish Museum of Natural History" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae7859c7-4602-434a-9b84-d5ee26703b97> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "NRM-BIO" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae7859c7-4602-434a-9b84-d5ee26703b97> <https://schema.org/description> "The department was formed in 2013 and brings together museum activities in informatics and genetics. We conduct research and development in these areas, and operate major national and international infrastructures. The department is divided into three groups: bioinformatics, DNA laboratory and research." .
