<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/96b684ad-8bb8-417c-96d0-fbbaa56f2522> <https://schema.org/name> "Khujand State University named after Academician Bobojon Ghafurov" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/96b684ad-8bb8-417c-96d0-fbbaa56f2522> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "KHSU" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/96b684ad-8bb8-417c-96d0-fbbaa56f2522> <https://schema.org/description> "The State Educational Institution \"Khujand State University named after academician Bobojon Gafurov\" is one of the oldest universities in the country since its establishment. Initially it was established as Khujand Higher Educational Institute (Leninabad Higher Pedagogical Institute) and in 1938 was named as Leninabad State Pedagogical Institute named after S.M.Kirov, and later in 1991 was awarded the status of the University. Currently, the University has the following faculties: Mathematics, Physics, Engineering, Fine Arts and Technology, Chemistry and Biology, Russian Philology, Tajik Philology, Uzbek Philology, Pedagogics, Foreign Languages, Oriental Studies, History and Law, Finance and Market Economy, Art, Geography and Ecology, Physical Education, Telecommunications and Information Technology, and the faculty of part time education for Uzbek schools (located in Jabbor Rasulov district)." .
