<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/294a1c5b-cc70-43ba-b2d8-b144af7d3d77> <https://schema.org/description> "Vitebsk State University named after P.M. Masherov, one of the oldest universities in Belarus. The University is a modern center in the field of multi-level social and humanitarian and natural science education. Key areas of activity: productive partnerships with leading foreign educational establishments, intensive development of student and staff academic mobility programs, active assistance in international scientific cooperation, project and grant activities in the field of science, education, and social and economic development of territories." .
