<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/32b3b3f4-cef1-43fa-8217-eeb48a671107> <https://schema.org/name> "Genetic Resources Institute, University of Banja Luka" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/32b3b3f4-cef1-43fa-8217-eeb48a671107> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UNIBL_IGR" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/32b3b3f4-cef1-43fa-8217-eeb48a671107> <https://schema.org/description> "The Genetic Resources Institutwas established as an organizational unit of the University in Banja Luka, a professional unit for the coordination and implementation of the Programme for Conservation of Plant Genetic Resources in the Republic of Srpska, and for all other actions in the field of conservation of plant genetic resources. Having adopted the Programme, the Republic of Srpska fulfilled one of the imperative obligations – a legal framework for the preservation of the biodiversity of cultivated plants, which is also a moral obligation of our generation towards future generations. The institute hosts the Plant Gene Bank of the Republic of Srpska (a political entity in Bosnia and Herzegovina), which has currently a seed bank collection and two living orchard collections - one in the Botanical Garden of the University in Banja Luka and one in Čajniče. Bosna and Herzerovina - the Republika Srpska entity." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/32b3b3f4-cef1-43fa-8217-eeb48a671107> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(17.21127 44.774545)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
