<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d22451d9-ed8a-4871-bc5a-36d1714b3f12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d22451d9-ed8a-4871-bc5a-36d1714b3f12> <https://schema.org/name> "State Scientific Institution “Institute of Experimental Botany Named After V.F. Kuprevich”" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d22451d9-ed8a-4871-bc5a-36d1714b3f12> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "MSK" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d22451d9-ed8a-4871-bc5a-36d1714b3f12> <https://schema.org/description> "The Institute is a leading scientific institution coordinating botanical and physiological-biochemical research in Belarus, provides scientific support for state regulation and management in the field of handling of plant world objects. Flora of Belarus (mainly), world flora. All taxonomic groups, including fungi and lichens" .
