<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/9bce3d39-1397-4a96-9850-a0290f59a1b0> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(13.039004 47.801805)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
