<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/89943bc0-4d89-4e6b-8d80-b4c6455f0fce> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "BRILLA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/89943bc0-4d89-4e6b-8d80-b4c6455f0fce> <https://schema.org/description> "The ancient La Brilla – Porta del Parco factory is owned by the Municipality of Massarosa and leased to the Migliarino, San Rossore and Massaciuccoli Regional Park Authority, which carried out the conservative restoration of the structure, enhancing its original architecture and creating a cultural, environmental, and hospitality hub, a key landmark for the area. Management has been granted to the La Brilla APS association, a non-profit organization registered with the RUNTS (National Association of Local Authorities). La Brilla APS is made up of a network of local associations active in promoting the area through environmental education projects, cultural events, sustainable tourism, and civic participation." .
