<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aac7f972-fad0-4d90-8238-1744a5fcf3fd> <https://schema.org/description> "Newton Abbot Town & GWR Museum explores the history of Newton Abbot and the local environs. From early settlement to the coming of the railway and beyond the museum tells the stories of local lives, industries and places that have helped to shape Newton Abbot over time. The museum’s mission is to be an accessible centre for learning, to excite curiosity and to promote understanding and appreciation of the cultural heritage of the town." .
