<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c3813ce6-3650-4e37-ac9f-7cb7ef224e10> <https://schema.org/name> "Zoological Museum of the University of Chittagong, Bangladesh" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c3813ce6-3650-4e37-ac9f-7cb7ef224e10> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ZMUC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c3813ce6-3650-4e37-ac9f-7cb7ef224e10> <https://schema.org/description> "he Zoological Museum of the University of Chittagong (ZMUC) is a natural history museum that is part of Zoology Department, University of Chittagong, Bangladesh. It was established by Zoology Department in 1973 as a teaching collection of zoological specimens and material for dissection. However, the museum has the prospect to be a vibrant natural history museum as it is in the Indo-Burma biodiversity zone, hosting a significant number of specimens from this area. The primary task of the Zoological Museum of the University of Chittagong is to collect and manage zoological specimens for scientific and study purposes." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c3813ce6-3650-4e37-ac9f-7cb7ef224e10> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(91.780423 22.467454)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

