<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/099e13a0-a999-4a74-8d50-8c769ee887b6> <https://schema.org/name> "Sree Narayana College Kollam" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/099e13a0-a999-4a74-8d50-8c769ee887b6> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SNCH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/099e13a0-a999-4a74-8d50-8c769ee887b6> <https://schema.org/description> "Sree Narayana College Herbarium (acronym SNCH), one of the pioneer herbaria of South India, is attached to the Post Graduate & Research Department of Botany, Sree Narayana College Kollam, which was established in the 1950s. At SNCH, our commitment is to provide plant authentication services based on critical morphological and taxonomic studies. Students and researchers are also encouraged to submit voucher specimens from their research to the SNCH. • SNCH is one of Kerala’s largest Herbaria • Digitalized and thoroughly documented the accessed specimens • Internationally recognized by the International Herbarium Index (Index Herbariorum)" .
