<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/493fe524-a02f-4552-b8cf-1aa9560d1bc0> <https://schema.org/name> "Museo de Zoología, Universidad Tecnológica Indoamérica (MZUTI)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/493fe524-a02f-4552-b8cf-1aa9560d1bc0> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "MZUTI" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/493fe524-a02f-4552-b8cf-1aa9560d1bc0> <https://schema.org/description> "The Zoology Museum of Universidad Tecnológica Indoamérica mantains scientific collections for research purposes. It remains wide open to national and international researchers, students, and former students. All the information associated with the collection contributes to numerous taxonomic, ecological, evolutionary, and conservation studies in our country." .
