<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <https://schema.org/name> "Centro de Investigación en Enfermedades Infecciosas y Vectoriales" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CIREV" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <https://schema.org/description> "El Centro Nacional de Referencia e Investigación de Vectores artrópodos del Instituto Nacional de Investigación en Salud Pública INSPI realiza investigación multidisciplinaria en vectores artrópodos de enfermedades de importancia médica para la salud pública con el objetivo de disminuir el impacto de éstas enfermedades en la población ecuatoriana. El CIREV realiza la identificación taxonómica y molecular de los artrópodos vectores; investigaciones en ecología y biología básica de vectores; estudios espacio temporales de la distribución de los vectores en el Ecuador; análisis de resistencia a pesticidas; desarrolla técnicas de monitoreo para mosquitos vectores y preserva ejemplares en la Colección de Referencia Nacional de Vectores Artrópodos del Ecuador." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(-78.497 -0.216)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c89ae698-eeb8-4410-b579-8f548f0e315c> <https://schema.org/logo> <http://www.investigacionsalud.gob.ec/webs/cirev/wp-content/uploads/2015/06/lgs/lgo_cirev.jpg> .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46bd6369-a61e-49c4-9876-b97d8d33e55e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46bd6369-a61e-49c4-9876-b97d8d33e55e> <https://schema.org/name> "National Fisheries Resources Research Institute (NaFIRRI)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46bd6369-a61e-49c4-9876-b97d8d33e55e> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "NaFIRRI" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46bd6369-a61e-49c4-9876-b97d8d33e55e> <https://schema.org/description> "A public National Agricultural Research Institutes (NARIs) under the policy guidance and co-ordination of the National Agricultural Research Organisation (NARO) which was established under the National Agriculture Research Act of 2005. NaFIRRI's mandate is to conduct basic and applied research of national and strategic importance in Aquaculture, Capture fisheries, Water environment, Socio-economics and Marketing, and Information Communication Management, and emerging issues in the fisheries sector. All water bodies in Uganda. Freshwater taxa (zooplankton, macroinvertebrates and fish" .
