<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e6deef9-61a0-4258-8411-43350edbcfbd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e6deef9-61a0-4258-8411-43350edbcfbd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e6deef9-61a0-4258-8411-43350edbcfbd> <https://schema.org/name> "Dorking Museum & Heritage Centre" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e6deef9-61a0-4258-8411-43350edbcfbd> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "DKMHC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/2e6deef9-61a0-4258-8411-43350edbcfbd> <https://schema.org/description> "Local Museum with displays and collections based on the local heritage and history of the Mole Valley area around the town of Dorking. Extensive local history collections of minerals, local fossils and significant dinosaur and prehistoric reptile and sea-dwelling creature remains. The town of Dorking in Mole Valley, Surrey, UK" .
