<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46468870-c6a4-42e2-a6b8-8320ee5030c8> <https://schema.org/name> "Khatlon Scientific Center of the National Academy of Sciences of Tajikistan, Kulob" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46468870-c6a4-42e2-a6b8-8320ee5030c8> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "Herbarium Khatlon Scientific Center Kulob" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46468870-c6a4-42e2-a6b8-8320ee5030c8> <https://schema.org/description> "The Khatlon Scientific Center of the National Academy of Sciences of Tajikistan is the first scientific and academic institution in the Khatlon region, established by the Decree of the Presidium of the Academy of Sciences of the Republic of Tajikistan No. 27 dated February 15, 1999. The scientific base for biological research of the Center is the Kulyab Botanical Garden named after Tillo Boboev. Kulyab (taj. Kulob) is a city in the Khatlon region of Tajikistan. It is located in the valley of the Yakhsu River (Pyanj basin), at the foot of the Khazratishoh ridge, 175 km southeast of the city of Dushanbe." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/46468870-c6a4-42e2-a6b8-8320ee5030c8> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <https://ror.org/040em2e23> .
