<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/547692ce-a6b3-4faf-8f96-96903f47f15d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/547692ce-a6b3-4faf-8f96-96903f47f15d> <https://schema.org/name> "Department of Zoology, Entomology and Fisheries Sciences, Makerere University" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/547692ce-a6b3-4faf-8f96-96903f47f15d> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ZEFS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/547692ce-a6b3-4faf-8f96-96903f47f15d> <https://schema.org/description> "The Department of Zoology, Entomology and Fisheries Sciences is engaged in training and research in the higher disciplines of biology, specifically, zoology, fisheries sciences, entomology, at the BSc, MSc and PhD levels. Within the department is a zoology museum that holds invertebrate and vertebrate specimen collections as well as records. Department staff and students are frequently involved in field research and data collection." .
