<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eba23aeb-3d81-46a3-9c4e-eb4dfb767d25> <https://schema.org/name> "Parque Natural Obô de São Tomé" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eba23aeb-3d81-46a3-9c4e-eb4dfb767d25> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ONPST" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eba23aeb-3d81-46a3-9c4e-eb4dfb767d25> <https://schema.org/description> "The Obô Natural Park of São Tomé is a natural park of São Tomé and Príncipe, covering 195 km² of the island of São Tomé. It was established in 2006. Since 2016, the Global Tree Campaign (GTC) has supported the Obô of Príncipe Natural Park in the establishment of a small herbarium with about 70 species. Copies of the various samples collected sent to five international herbariums and the National Herbarium of Sao Tome. Plants of Obô of Príncipe Natural Park. Plants" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/eba23aeb-3d81-46a3-9c4e-eb4dfb767d25> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(6.548338 0.193576)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

