<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4375da5c-5a2c-425f-857a-5e9700af10fc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4375da5c-5a2c-425f-857a-5e9700af10fc> <https://schema.org/name> "University of Michigan Museum of Natural History" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4375da5c-5a2c-425f-857a-5e9700af10fc> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UMMNH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4375da5c-5a2c-425f-857a-5e9700af10fc> <https://schema.org/description> "The University of Michigan Museum of Natural History transforms hearts and minds by promoting understanding of the natural world, our place in it, and our impact on it. We bring campus and community together in participatory and inclusive learning experiences to explore the processes of science and to address urgent global and local challenges." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4375da5c-5a2c-425f-857a-5e9700af10fc> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q7895767> .
