<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a37b1769-dfa8-41c2-b417-bb2fc3aaa81a> <https://schema.org/name> "Station d'Ecologie de Lamto" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a37b1769-dfa8-41c2-b417-bb2fc3aaa81a> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SEL" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a37b1769-dfa8-41c2-b417-bb2fc3aaa81a> <https://schema.org/description> "The Ecology Station of Lamto is an ecological research station located in the center of Côte d'Ivoire. It is attached to Nangui Abrogoua University of Abidjan. Since its foundation, this station has been an active center for multidisciplinary study and training in tropical ecology. It is home to numerous collections of bees, ants, savanna herbaria and biodiversity data information’s." .
