<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da4bad98-f46a-4ec2-8b9d-e6e8d7ac786f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da4bad98-f46a-4ec2-8b9d-e6e8d7ac786f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da4bad98-f46a-4ec2-8b9d-e6e8d7ac786f> <https://schema.org/name> "Father Saturnino Urios University" .
