<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da4bad98-f46a-4ec2-8b9d-e6e8d7ac786f> <https://schema.org/description> "The Father Saturnino Urios University-Biodiversity Informatics and Research Center manages a biodiversity database and a reference natural history collection composed mostly of amphibians and reptiles from the Caraga Region and selected parts of the southern Philippines collected since 2009–present." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/da4bad98-f46a-4ec2-8b9d-e6e8d7ac786f> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(125.54206 8.94808)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .
