<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8da0e86c-211b-491e-b825-742a33dc0a20> <https://schema.org/name> "USDA Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8da0e86c-211b-491e-b825-742a33dc0a20> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "USDA-NRCS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8da0e86c-211b-491e-b825-742a33dc0a20> <https://schema.org/description> "The Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS) draws on a long history of helping people help the land. NRCS and its predecessor agencies have worked in close partnerships with farmers and ranchers, local and state governments, and other federal agencies to maintain healthy and productive working landscapes. Collections from across the United States. Soil, water, and biological collections." .
