<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fed1db25-03ef-497f-b587-deeab6e99826> <https://schema.org/name> "Center for the Evolutionary Origins of Human Behavior, Kyoto University" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fed1db25-03ef-497f-b587-deeab6e99826> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "EHUB" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/fed1db25-03ef-497f-b587-deeab6e99826> <https://schema.org/description> "EHUB was founded in April 2022, at the Kyoto University Inuyama campus, Aichi. Our mission is to carry out multidisciplinary researches and educational activities through experimental approaches with non-human primates to better understand evolutionary origings of human behaviors. We promote a wide range of biological researches exploring body and brain structures, molecular functions, brain functions and congnive abilities which provide a foundation of human behaviours. Worldwide. Vertebrates (mainly primates)" .
