<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c7d5c4da-9590-49c2-b87c-f0e7932611a6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c7d5c4da-9590-49c2-b87c-f0e7932611a6> <https://schema.org/name> "Beaty Biodiversity Museum" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c7d5c4da-9590-49c2-b87c-f0e7932611a6> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "BBM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c7d5c4da-9590-49c2-b87c-f0e7932611a6> <https://schema.org/description> "Biodiversity Museum of the University of British Columbia (UBC) with six main collections: Herbarium, Fish Collection, Cowan Tetrapod Collection, Spencer Entomological Collection, Marine Invertebrate Collection and Fossil Collection. Worldwide but with emphasis on Pacific Northwest of North America. All multicellular biodiversity (including fossil), especially, vascular plants, bryophytes, macroalgae, lichens and fungi, all vertebrates, marine invertebrates, insects" .
