<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/83814b51-a827-4e9f-8eee-f16a8e4d13a1> <https://schema.org/description> "When the College of Fisheries and Ocean Sciences was envisioned in 1972 as the center of Fisheries education in the country, the plan included a museum as an independent unit. That museum is now the University of the Philippines Visayas Museum of Natural Sciences located at the Ground Floor of the Library Building, UPV Miagao, Iloilo." .
