<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/86875e28-19fe-49ab-82f3-101e63eebc0e> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PSPG" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/86875e28-19fe-49ab-82f3-101e63eebc0e> <https://schema.org/description> "Indonesian: PUSAT STUDI PANGAN DAN GIZI. PSPG was established to support the development of the tridharma of higher education, especially in conducting research in the field of food and nutrition as well as providing services to the community. This Study Center is supported by experts in food and related fields within UGM. Most of the experts have Doctoral degrees, graduates from leading universities both at home and abroad, and laboratory technicians are trained and experienced. The facilities available are in the form of a laboratory equipped with analysis and testing equipment, as well as supporting research and other education." .
