<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3a203761-09c9-4edb-a3e5-b89d43a59022> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3a203761-09c9-4edb-a3e5-b89d43a59022> <https://schema.org/name> "Lancashire County Museums Service" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3a203761-09c9-4edb-a3e5-b89d43a59022> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "LANMS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3a203761-09c9-4edb-a3e5-b89d43a59022> <https://schema.org/description> "A group of museums and collections which relate to the County Palatine of Lancashire and are owned, managed or administered by Lancashire County Museums Service. Natural Sciences collections are on display at Clitheroe Castle and in storage at Preston. We manage some Natural Science collections on behalf of the Ribble Valley Borough Council. Collecting area is County Palatine of Lancashire and we hold significant natural sciences collections in geology and palaeontology from this area. Other Natural Science collection has been of examples which are UK wide. A small amount of the natural science collections are worldwide." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/3a203761-09c9-4edb-a3e5-b89d43a59022> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <https://ror.org/03snfqm79> .
