<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aaabba1a-b280-4ef7-99fd-efb641cff0c2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aaabba1a-b280-4ef7-99fd-efb641cff0c2> <https://schema.org/name> "Instituto de Recursos Naturales y Agrobiología de Salamanca (CSIC)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aaabba1a-b280-4ef7-99fd-efb641cff0c2> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CSIC-IRNASA" .
