<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e7fbfa7b-ae8f-480c-8864-6fd2b34e6936> <https://schema.org/name> "INIA. Centro Nacional de Recursos Fitogenéticos (CSIC)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e7fbfa7b-ae8f-480c-8864-6fd2b34e6936> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CSIC-INIA-CRF" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/e7fbfa7b-ae8f-480c-8864-6fd2b34e6936> <https://schema.org/description> "The CRF is a National Centre focus on the conservation and the use of plant genetic resources in Spain. The Centre is in charge of the conservation of the security duplicates of all the collections of the National Programme Network that are conserved by seed, and is responsible for updating and publishing the National Inventory (https://bancocrf.inia.es/es/). It also supplies the genetic material of its active collections to different users, from farmers to national and international researchers." .
