<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/257a3f18-8269-42d9-90ef-03bee44ca73c> <https://schema.org/description> "The CEAB is a research center belonging to the CSIC that started its activity in October 1985 and is currently focusing its research activities in studying the organisms’ ecology and biology both in marine and continental water ecosystems." .
