<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c13adcfd-e76c-4d58-9595-f48a18ce3868> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "YPYM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c13adcfd-e76c-4d58-9595-f48a18ce3868> <https://schema.org/description> "The Yamaguchi Prefectural Museum started as the Bocho Educational Museum in 1912 and was moved to its present location as a Yamaguchi Prefectural Educational Museum in 1917. The museum was reconstructed and became a comprehensive museum with science and technology, astronomy, natural science, and humanities sections." .
