<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f8b538e6-f4a2-4c07-8159-b41d0fd28b65> <https://schema.org/name> "PACEA laboratory of the University of Bordeaux" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f8b538e6-f4a2-4c07-8159-b41d0fd28b65> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PACEA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f8b538e6-f4a2-4c07-8159-b41d0fd28b65> <https://schema.org/description> "The PACEA laboratory houses a collection of about 3000 specimens represented by a skeletal or dental element up to the complete skeleton. The collection also includes 3D models rendered from CT-scans of specimens preserved in the lab of other establishments. The taxa represented are large mammals and birds and, to a lesser extent, small herpetological fauna and fish. This collection covers the European as well as the Caribbean areas." .
