<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/4a4f2c3f-92c0-40d1-8f85-926ba00bc8fa> <https://schema.org/description> "The Sagamihara City Museum is a municipal museum located in Chuo Ward, Sagamihara City, Kanagawa Prefecture. Since its opening in 1995, it has become a popular comprehensive museum for citizens, showcasing the history and nature of Sagamihara, and in March 2024, the number of visitors exceeded 3.5 million." .
