<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/49efc929-ebe7-419d-8d0c-e22d984c30a8> <https://schema.org/description> "Faculty of Science - University of Sarajevo is leading scientific and research institution in the field of biodiversity investigations and conservation in Bosnia and Herzegovina. During more than 60 years of active research of our rich and very diverse biological resources, Faculty of Science has collected a very impresive datasets on various species and habitat types which we would like now to share using GBIF methodology. AT the Faculty of Science there is modern GIS center with Unit for Habitat and Species Mapping which provides hosting for all of our data." .
