<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7e6d04cf-999f-4756-ba67-8ce2b21237df> <https://schema.org/name> "Departement d'Etude du Milieu Naturel et Agricole (DEMNA)" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7e6d04cf-999f-4756-ba67-8ce2b21237df> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SPW-DEMNA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7e6d04cf-999f-4756-ba67-8ce2b21237df> <https://schema.org/description> "The Departement d'Etude du Milieu Naturel et Agricole (DEMNA) develops and coordinates all programs for the acquisition, validation, valorization and dissemination of socio-economic and environmental data in the fields of agriculture and the environment in Wallonia, Belgium. The DEMNA is a part to the Operational General Directorate for Agriculture, Natural Resources and the Environment (DGO3-DGARNE) of the Walloon Public Service (SPW). Wallonia, Belgium. The DEMNA expertise covers all main animal and plants groups. Preserved specimens collections mostly concerns insects and macroinvertebrates samples from recent monitoring programs." .
