<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aea0e0b0-b7db-433e-b8d0-9415916bd7eb> <https://schema.org/name> "Institute of Tropical Medicine Antwerp" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aea0e0b0-b7db-433e-b8d0-9415916bd7eb> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ITM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/aea0e0b0-b7db-433e-b8d0-9415916bd7eb> <https://schema.org/description> "GLOBAL SCIENCE FOR HEALTH WORLDWIDE: Tropical diseases, HIV/AIDS, tuberculosis and inadequate health care influence the lives of billions of people worldwide. The Institute of Tropical Medicine in Antwerp, Belgium, promotes the advancement of science and health for all, through innovative research, advanced education, professional services and capacity building of partner institutions in the Africa, Asia and Latin America. For us, scientific excellence and societal impact are two sides of the same coin." .
