<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df2f787b-e54a-4902-8212-390bb2bc7b21> <https://schema.org/description> "The Research Institute for Nature and Forest (INBO) is the independent research institute of the Flemish government that underpins and evaluates biodiversity policy and management by means of applied scientific research, data and knowledge sharing. Flemish and Belgian bio- and geodiversity." .
