<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dfa4658-b35a-430b-8f60-207ed5045850> <https://schema.org/name> "Marine Science Museum, Tawi-Tawi College of Technology and Oceanography, Mindanao State University" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dfa4658-b35a-430b-8f60-207ed5045850> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "MSU-MSM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8dfa4658-b35a-430b-8f60-207ed5045850> <https://schema.org/description> "The Marine Science Museum is part of the flagship programs engaged in marine biological collection research, classification, curation, identification and osteological collection of marine biodiversity specimens endemic in the entire intertidal reef flats, fringing reef system and deep water marine environment in the island-municipalities of Tawi-Tawi and surrounding aquatic habitats; and in operating and maintaining marine biodiversity exhibitions for local government units, regional, national and international visitors, marine scientists, researchers, students, children and community stakeholders in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARRM). Collections of marine biological specimens show different phyla in the Animal Kingdom, namely : Phylum Arthropoda, phylum Cnidaria, phylum Echinodermata, phylum Mollusca, phylum Platyhelminthes and phylum Vertebrata together with phylum Chlorophyta, Phaeophyta and Rhodophyta" .
