<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/adef94b3-a220-439d-b9c4-e0aa6cb191ad> <https://schema.org/description> "The Norwegian Veterinary Institute is a biomedical research institute, and the national leading centre of expertise in biosecurity in fish and land animals." .
