<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a9b673c6-7321-419e-8219-60686f7420d8> <https://schema.org/name> "Embrapa Florestas" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a9b673c6-7321-419e-8219-60686f7420d8> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "Embrapa Florestas" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a9b673c6-7321-419e-8219-60686f7420d8> <https://schema.org/description> "Embrapa Florestas is a research center of the Brazilian Agricultural Research Corporation (Embrapa), linked to the Ministry of Agriculture and Livestock (MAPA). It is dedicated to generating, adapting, and transferring scientific and technological knowledge aimed at the sustainable development of forestry and agroforestry systems in Brazil. Its activities include research on forest conservation and restoration, native and exotic species management, forest genetics and improvement, biotechnology, ecosystem services, and climate change mitigation. Embrapa Florestas also supports public policies, provides technical guidance, and promotes innovation in partnership with government agencies, academia, and the private sector." .
