<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/693c6e75-7b63-43ae-88f5-dd120dc0f2cd> <https://schema.org/name> "Jurica-Suchy Nature Museum" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/693c6e75-7b63-43ae-88f5-dd120dc0f2cd> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "JSNM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/693c6e75-7b63-43ae-88f5-dd120dc0f2cd> <https://schema.org/description> "The Jurica-Suchy Nature Museum is a repository for a wide range of high-quality zoological, geological, and botanical specimens. As an institution, we strive to provide a transformative and integrative educational experience for diverse audiences, to support life science research and inquiry, and to provide access to the collections and their associated data for the scientific community as well as the public. In pursuit of this goal, we have fully digitized our Paleontological and Oological research collections and are currently in the process of digitizing our Herbarium collection. This effort will help to make our specimens and data more available for use by a wide audience across the globe." .
