<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/b2e899cd-bccc-4185-b781-4a3733a82408> <https://schema.org/name> "KSCSTE-Malabar Botanical Garden and Institute for Plant Sciences" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/b2e899cd-bccc-4185-b781-4a3733a82408> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "MBGH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/b2e899cd-bccc-4185-b781-4a3733a82408> <https://schema.org/description> "KSCSTE-Malabar Botanical Garden & Institute for Plant Sciences (KSCSTE-MBGIPS) is an institution of the Government of Kerala, administered by the Kerala State Council for Science Technology and Environment (KSCSTE), dedicated to the conservation and research on aquatic plant diversity, lower group plants, endangered plants of the erstwhile Malabar Region, as well as disseminating knowledge on various facets of plant sciences. By virtue of possessing a vast morass land, the Malabar Botanical Garden and Institute for Plant Sciences becomes unique in the nation ideal for ex situ conservation of aquatic/wetland plants and for undertaking research on them. The educational value of the Garden lies with the descriptive labels displayed for the different sections and plants." .
