<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/43c9bde7-8fce-46e0-a508-415b19fc99e5> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "RANK" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/43c9bde7-8fce-46e0-a508-415b19fc99e5> <https://schema.org/description> "Kermanshah Agricultural and Natural Resources Research and Education Center, as one of the centers under the Agricultural Research, Education and Promotion Organization, is in charge of agricultural research, natural resources, and agricultural Education in Kermanshah province. After about 5 decades of activity in the form of different administrative structures, this center was merged with Kermanshah Agricultural Jihad Education Center in 2015 and after that it operates under the name \"Kermanshah Province Agriculture and Natural Resources Research and Education Center\"." .
