<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a507e0f1-9194-402a-bf96-d92e4ca0a0cf> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UBDH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a507e0f1-9194-402a-bf96-d92e4ca0a0cf> <https://schema.org/description> "Founded in 1990, the UBDH contains about 20,000 collections of plants, mainly from Brunei Darussalam and East Kalimantan (Indonesia), but also from China (ferns). About 75% of the collections are vouchers from our plot networks, but we also have very extensive Bryophyte (~3000) and fern (~1000) collections. Our botanical collections (i.e., specifically collected as part of botanical collection activities) consist of about 1500 specimens. This includes marine specimens such as algae and sea grasses." .
