<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae2cacfd-cd68-4418-9693-fc231762e756> <https://schema.org/description> "The Eastern Nevada Landscape Coalition&#39;s Herbarium specializes in the vascular plants of Nevada with particular emphasis on the Mojave and Great Basin Deserts." .
