<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/5dc9164d-8802-4aa5-9006-35305dacbb46> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/5dc9164d-8802-4aa5-9006-35305dacbb46> <https://schema.org/name> "Afribugs" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/5dc9164d-8802-4aa5-9006-35305dacbb46> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "AFRC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/5dc9164d-8802-4aa5-9006-35305dacbb46> <https://schema.org/description> "AfriBugs is an environmental consultancy focussing on specialist studies of terrestrial invertebrates and houses an extensive reference collection of Afrotropical ants (Formicidae) as well as a smaller collection of leafhoppers (Cicadellidae); both groups are used as biodiversity and ecological indicators in environmental impact assessments and rehabilitation monitoring programmes." .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df860761-6ad7-4775-a7c3-540598144abf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df860761-6ad7-4775-a7c3-540598144abf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Museum> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df860761-6ad7-4775-a7c3-540598144abf> <https://schema.org/name> "Iranian Research Institute of Plant Protection; Agricultural Zoology Museum of Iran" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df860761-6ad7-4775-a7c3-540598144abf> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "IRIPP" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/df860761-6ad7-4775-a7c3-540598144abf> <https://schema.org/description> "Agricultural Zoology Museum of Iran holds various collections, namely mites, rodents, birds, snails &amp; slugs, spiders, etc." .
