<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/74ae2bc3-e5a8-443f-bc8b-89cc223500d1> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "NOC" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/74ae2bc3-e5a8-443f-bc8b-89cc223500d1> <https://schema.org/description> "http://noc.ac.uk/about-us/our-organisation http://noc.ac.uk/data/discovery-collections The Discovery Collections comprises both benthic and pelagic samples from many parts of the World&#39;s oceans. They have a long and illustrious history beginning in 1925 when the first samples were collected in the Southern Ocean by Scott&rsquo;s ship Discovery." .
