<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7fdfbdb4-73c0-4cdd-950f-13884e2087ac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7fdfbdb4-73c0-4cdd-950f-13884e2087ac> <https://schema.org/name> "Jardín Botánico José Celestino Mutis" .
