<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/298cac1e-a899-4c4b-a1ef-010118970cbd> <https://schema.org/description> "The Witte Museum inspires people to shape the future of Texas through relevant and transformative experiences in nature, science and culture. As San Antonio’s most-visited museum, the Witte reaches a diverse audience of hundreds of thousands from within Bexar County and beyond." .
