<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/532a631f-b0af-492d-b0e1-614ecb5051f2> <https://schema.org/description> "The Biodiversity Research Collections of the University of Connecticut comprise both zoological (vertebrate and invertebrate) and plant (herbarium and greenhouse) collections. The facility is under the administration of the Department of Ecology and Evolutionary Biology. The acronym UCONN applies to the zoological collections." .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/53424d53-5d10-4175-91c7-50ef0babc44b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/53424d53-5d10-4175-91c7-50ef0babc44b> <https://schema.org/name> "Riding Mountain National Park" .
