<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0392ccbf-9a90-422e-9192-e285c39b4675> <https://schema.org/description> "Ipswich collections are across natural sciences, world cultures, archaeology, social history and art displayed across 3 venues: Ipswich Museum, Ipswich Art Gallery, and Christchurch Mansion. All located in Ipswich city. Research is supported across all collection areas, and research requests are considered on individual merit, with reference to the Colchester and Ipswich Museums Research Policy. Colchester Museum collections are not considered in this survey submission (will be submiited separately). Global: across UK, but particularly Suffolk; European continent: particularly France, Belgium; Iceland; Middle East, Russia, East Asia particularly India and also China, African continent, Australia, New Zealand, Oceania, USA, Canada, Mexico, South American continent." .
