<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1cc54abe-6d38-4ddc-85c6-ba49b853903f> <https://schema.org/description> "The Entomological Society of Egypt was founded on August 1st 1907 by a group of non-professional entomologists brought together by their common interest in insects development and their natural history. Over the the whole of Egypt including oases in the Western Desert, the Sinai Peninsula and the mountainous regions in the Eastern Deserts. Orthoptera, Dermaptera, Neuroptera, Coleoptera, Hymenoptera, Hemiptera and Diptera" .

