<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/25cafa31-7cd0-4428-92be-9a3a9563b0f9> <https://schema.org/description> "The Collections Databases Databases for the Museum's collections are available online, but currently only in Japanese. They can be accessed via the Collections Databases page Other Databases Currently, there is one database available in English: Natural Woodlands Ground Beetles Other databases are in Japanese and can be accessed from Japanese site: WEB zukan. The databases are: Freshwater Diatoms of Japan Volcanic Tuffs of the Lake Biwa region Weather Data Collected from the Museum's Weather Station Database of Biota in Rice Paddies and Adjacent Areas" .
