<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/8a8a76e1-2465-4f6a-90ad-02fdd310ca92> <https://schema.org/description> "The National Agricultural Research and Extension Institute (NAREI) was established following the assent of the National Agricultural Research and Extension Institute Act 2010 in March 2011. Its creation expanded the services offered by the then National Agricultural Research Institute, which was formed in 1984.NAREI continues to promote greater efficiency in the crops and agricultural product industry; providing enhanced services in Agricultural Research, Extension and Crop Protection thereby allowing effective administration and regulation of trade, commerce and export of crops and agricultural products." .

