<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/f00c1f94-8fbf-4fc0-ac39-abeb3ec48723> <https://schema.org/description> "The FDA is responsible for protecting and promoting public health through the regulation and supervision of food safety, tobacco products, dietary supplements, prescription and over-the-counter pharmaceutical drugs (medications), vaccines, biopharmaceuticals, blood transfusions, medical devices, electromagnetic radiation emitting devices, cosmetics, animal foods &amp; feed, and veterinary products." .

