<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/be2ed18d-caf9-4e73-9211-f6a0224c106d> <https://schema.org/description> "The Great North Museum: Hancock is a museum of natural history and ancient civilisations in Newcastle upon Tyne, England. The museum was established in 1884 and was formerly known as the Hancock Museum. Every major continent and many oceanic islands. Marine collections from locations around the world." .
