<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7375b3f8-fd3a-49ec-b4fd-0c3ecbbcc7a1> <https://schema.org/name> "Centre of Excellence in Marine Biology" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7375b3f8-fd3a-49ec-b4fd-0c3ecbbcc7a1> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CEMB" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7375b3f8-fd3a-49ec-b4fd-0c3ecbbcc7a1> <https://schema.org/description> "The Centre is housed in its own building at the Campus of the University of Karachi. The buildup area is 23340 sq. ft. It has a fish aquarium annexed to it and a research library of centre has good collection of 5210 books and 1670 research journals of which 400 are local journals and 1270 are foreign. The library has high speed internet facility and a wide range of online journals are available through HEC digital library. The Centre has a fish museum in which more than 500 specimens of local marine fishes and 200 specimens of marine invertebrates are housed. This museum is mainly used for teaching purposes. The centre has a shore laboratory on Sandspit beach, about 35 Km away from the main campus. The laboratory is mainly used by researchers who visit sea-side for collection of marine animals" .
