<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/08c5b6b9-defd-46b6-afa8-e41123ddef40> <https://schema.org/description> "The WVDA insect collection houses an estimated 250,000 specimens representing over 6,000 species. Over 90% of the specimens are from West Virginia, making it the largest insect collection in the state. Taxonomic strengths of the collection are Hemiptera and Coleoptera." .
