<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/10d484df-d505-47f6-8e4d-3dc2498511b3> <https://schema.org/description> "Glasgow Life Museums includes Kelvingrove Art Gallery and Museum, Riverside Museum, Gallery of Modern Art, People's Palace, St Mungo Museum of Religious Life and Art, Provand's Lordship, Glasgow Museums Resource Centre (GMRC), Scotland Street School Museum and The Burrell Collection. Collections are predominantly from Scotland and the UK, with particular emphasis on the west of Scotland and the Glasgow area, however there are also large worldwide collections." .
