<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/91cf7262-cce9-43ab-beae-310dd45b115d> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "CCOS" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/91cf7262-cce9-43ab-beae-310dd45b115d> <https://schema.org/description> "The CCOS is the national public culture collection for microorganisms in Switzerland. We accurately characterize and provide these strains in high quality for research and industry applications. We want to offer you the right strain for your application and have been designed to become a main repository for cell lines, bacteria and yeast strains as well as their plasmids. Based on the knowledge of the culture collection we want to provide our customers high quality services like backup solution in cryostorage and lyophilisation as well as analytical services." .

