<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d9ef92fc-5bdf-493c-95b0-323c794004ea> <https://schema.org/description> "Present holdings include over 200,000 vascular plants, 100,000 fungi and 30,000 bryophytes in the accessioned collection and several tens of thousands of unprocessed specimens. The Herbarium serves well to document the flora of the state. All groups, mainly New York and north temperate region." .
