<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d5cf76e4-e067-4b76-86dc-592b44f49918> <https://schema.org/description> "The Israel Plant Gene Bank (IGB) of the Agricultural Research Organization is the national center in Israel to preserve the genetic resources of regional vegetation. It serves as a physical repository for collected seeds for current and future development, as well as a program to collect and conserve wild plants and Landraces seeds from natural habitats all over Israel." .
