<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/37743462-a39f-40ad-9fbc-13b17ed7776d> <https://schema.org/description> "The National Center for Genetic and Biological Resources of Iran was established in 2016, by the order of the Supreme Leader (Madzaleh Al-Aali) in Jihad, and the main goal of the center is to establish a national reference center in order to preserve and use genetic resources and life of Iran. In this regard, this center, while supporting the country's biological reserves centers and creating a national network of biological reserves, is trying to become a leading center in order to collect, complete, organize, standardize and preserve genetic and biological reserves for the development of knowledge, technology and Increasing the quality of life and health and maintaining food security, natural resources and biodiversity of the country" .
