<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/411db009-b6eb-473b-8239-52760ba3c4f7> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "ZMUP" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/411db009-b6eb-473b-8239-52760ba3c4f7> <https://schema.org/description> "The Zoological Museum of the University of Patras was founded in 1968 and it operates under the auspices of the Department of Biology. The collections of the Museum house over 3500 samples of vertebrate species and about 4000 samples of invertebrate species, and most of them are electronically catalogued. In 2018, the Museum has begun to digitize its collections. These new additions include an electronic catalogue of the specimens in the collections, provide access to virtual specimens over the internet and focus on environmental education via new material on urban biodiversity. The collections can be visited freely for research purposes by any researcher." .
