<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0a368cb2-cc40-4f79-90a3-0bbf5e3a697d> <https://schema.org/description> "The University of Aveiro (UA), founded in 1973, is a public higher education institution recognized nationally and internationally for the quality of its education, research, and innovation. With a strong interdisciplinary character and a close connection to its surrounding region, UA has continuously adapted its scientific and educational activities to technological change and societal challenges, maintaining a consistent focus on quality and modernization. Located in the Aveiro region and organized across several campuses set within architecturally and environmentally distinctive spaces, the University offers a stimulating environment for academic, scientific, and cultural development, and serves as a venue for events, training activities, and community engagement." .
