<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/61ec65f7-02d6-40ac-bba4-71287b04a54c> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Mar 2009. The herbarium contains ca 11,000 specimens of marine algae, databased and available in four types of collections (liquid, pressed, silica and air dried). The database holds information on the taxonomy, ecology and biology of the taxa. The fresh water microalgae collection holds ca 2000 samples and their respective microscope slide mounts. The vascular plants collection is databased and holds ca 5000 pressed specimens and ca 1100 silica dried and vacuum sealed specimens pertaining to the Azorean flora DNA bank. Algae and vascular plants of the Azores." .
