<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/6d04f22b-e989-43e2-8b71-4fe86de46ebe> <https://schema.org/description> "The herbarium of the Barcelona Botanical Institute, known internationally by the initials BC, specialises in the flora of the western Mediterranean region. This Herbarium is integrated by the general herbarium of vascular plants, some historical collections collected in the XVIII and XIX centuries and some collections of mosses, lichens and mushrooms and algae. Europe; Mediterranean and Ibero-Magrebine regions; worldwide." .
