<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/bc27fb5b-91c6-4cdc-ae49-fc79e2e44c3f> <https://schema.org/name> "Associazione micologica Giacomo Bresadola" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/bc27fb5b-91c6-4cdc-ae49-fc79e2e44c3f> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "BRES" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/bc27fb5b-91c6-4cdc-ae49-fc79e2e44c3f> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Apr 2009. The Associazione Micologica Bresadola was founded in Trento, 7 December 1957. It was originally called \"Gruppo Micologico G. Bresadola\". This name derives from the Abbot Giacomo Bresadola, one of the most important mycologists. In 1987 the name was changed to \"Associazione Micologica Bresadola\". The aim of the Association is to bring together people who are interested in mycology and conservation of fungi. The Association carries on intense editorial, scientific, legislative and local a. Macrofungi, wood decay fungi" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/bc27fb5b-91c6-4cdc-ae49-fc79e2e44c3f> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(11.112647 46.06493)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

