<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ff0ab64e-fcf7-440e-ae3f-0fa9118c01de> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Jul 2012. CATA is interested in developing active exchange programs with other herbaria specializing in the Southern California Floristic Province and/or Mediterranean floras worldwide. Please contact the curator for details.; ; Visits to the herbarium can be arranged through the Catalina Island Conservancy. Most visitors to the island travel via ferry (www.catalinaexpress.com), approximately an hour boat ride from Long Beach, CA. The herbarium is located at the Wrigley Memorial Botanical Garden. For details, contact the Conservancy or herbarium staff. Vascular plants of the California Channel Islands, particularly of Catalina Island." .
