<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0f370b29-4e57-4ce9-964f-dc8c209932a6> <https://schema.org/name> "Stroud District (Cowle) Museum Service" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0f370b29-4e57-4ce9-964f-dc8c209932a6> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "STGCM" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0f370b29-4e57-4ce9-964f-dc8c209932a6> <https://schema.org/description> "The Stroud District (Cowle) Museum Service is a partnership between the Cowle Trust (legal guardians of the collections) and Stroud District Council. The public facing aspect of the service is the Museum in the Park. The Museum's collections comprise c.60,000 artefacts taking in all classifications relating to geological, natural and human history in the Stroud District. The majority of the collections relate to the Stroud District. However, some of the geological and natural history material is from further afield - though still primarily within the UK. In these cases the collector is likely to have had a connection with the Stroud District." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/0f370b29-4e57-4ce9-964f-dc8c209932a6> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(-2.240431 51.745145)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

