<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/CollegeOrUniversity> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <https://schema.org/name> "University of Gdansk" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "UGDA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <https://schema.org/description> "The University of Gdańsk is one of the leading academic institutions in Poland, established in 1970 and located in the city of Gdańsk. The University conducts scientific research and provides education across a wide range of disciplines, with a particular focus on natural sciences, biology, and environmental protection. Due to its geographic location, a significant part of the university’s research and data collection is concentrated on the biodiversity of the Baltic Sea and the Pomeranian region. The University of Gdańsk actively supports the principles of open science and the sharing of scientific data, including biodiversity information, through national and international initiatives such as the Polish Biodiversity Information Network (KSIB) and the Polish Node of the Global Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF Poland). Currently, biodiversity data are published by the Faculty of Biology and its units: Bird Migration Research Station, Herbarium of the University of Gdańsk – Herbarium Universitatis Gedanensis (UGDA), Department of Plant Taxonomy and Nature Conservation, Biological Resource Center Gdańsk which collect, curate, and share valuable floristic and faunistic data, supporting scientific research, education, and nature conservation efforts." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/14d28032-e644-4773-b105-b9702bb7b7cc> <https://schema.org/sameAs> <https://ror.org/011dv8m48> .
