<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/59ff53c6-b31a-4f8c-a0a5-cc4773af427a> <https://schema.org/description> "University of Ibadan is in Ibadan, Nigeria. The university has a herbarium located in the Department of Botany. It is an internationally recognized herbarium where various functions including plant Identification are carried out. The herbarium (UIH) has over twenty six thousand collections of flowering plants mainly from Nigeria and Cameroon. There are also Bryophyte collections. Vascular plants, mainly of Nigeria and Cameroon. Flowering plants mainly from Nigeria and Cameroon. There are also Bryophyte collections." .
