<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/5fa18fe0-07ba-4f4f-b9b7-2bc71788aa0c> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Jul 2010. Number of specimens in the herbarium unknown. Bound volumes in the herbarium include:; H. De Rochebrune: Herbier de De Rochebrune 53 boxes (1850-1860);; Jean-François Laterrade (1784-1858), Flore de la Gironde 7 boxes;; Jean-François Laterrade, Flore générale 8 boxes;; Lucien Dupray (-1902), Antoine Mougeot (1815-1889) and Casimir Roumeguère (1828-1892) Algues de France 10 parts;; Casimir Roumeguère Lichens d'Europe 39 parts;; Casimir Roumeguère Mousses de l'Aude 11 parts;; Casimir Roumeguère Mousses Alp. d'Europe 22 parts;; Pierre Tranquille Husnot (1840-1929) Algae Europae 11 parts. European specimens (vascular plants, algae, lichens and mosses) collected between 1830 and 1930" .
