<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/673c3538-34df-4380-ba85-756b8ee11522> <https://schema.org/name> "Southern Institute of Ecology" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/673c3538-34df-4380-ba85-756b8ee11522> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "SGN" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/673c3538-34df-4380-ba85-756b8ee11522> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Dec 2012. SGN is a new herbarium established for botanical research at the new Southern Institute of Ecology under Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology and based in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. We are making several thousands of collections in many expeditions a year and expanding collections in other parts of the country. SGN appreciates exchanges of related collections from the tropical and sub-tropical Asia. SGN presently includes collections of vascular plants, bryophytes and macro-fungi collected mostly from Southern Vietnam." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/673c3538-34df-4380-ba85-756b8ee11522> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(106.679 10.878)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

