<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/7c9fe881-8ae1-43f1-a9ad-8f5b2833e96b> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Jul 2012. Bryophyte collections made by Dr. A.E. Dulip Daniels and his research fellows since 1995 from the Western Ghats in Peninsular India. This herbarium holds exclusively bryophyte specimens. The specimens document continuing studies in various parts of the Western Ghats in peninsular India. There are also some some African specimens gifted to the Herbarium by Mr. M.J. Wigginton and Himalayan specimens gifted by Dr. D.G. Long (E)." .
