<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/ae99c40b-c5f3-42f8-807c-de4ba4ceb3b9> <https://schema.org/description> "Sohag University (Arabic: جامعة سوهاج) is a public university in Egypt. It is located in Sohag, on the eastern bank of the Nile. Sohag University became an independent university in 2006. Before 2006, it was part, and branch, of South Valley University which is located in Qena. Egypt, especially eastern desert, Sinai, and Gebel Elba." .
