<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/01ce0475-3150-42f2-9e21-7d60061101fd> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Nov 2010. The University Herbarium, established in 1911, holds botanical collections from around the Ukraine and from around the world. The Herbarium includes over 762 species, and 73 mutant lines Arabidopsis thaliana (L.) Henh. (including 40 monomutants, 28 dimutants, 6 - threemutants, 4 tetramutants, 3 - pentamutants, 2 - hexamutants). These polimutant lines were synthesized at the Department of Plant Biology Luhansk National Agrarian University, under the guidance of I.D. Sokolov and L.I. Sigidinenko. The University Herbarium specializes in the vascular plants South - East of Ukraine." .
