<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60761bb7-ebc6-4d85-87ef-38c38f5865ac> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60761bb7-ebc6-4d85-87ef-38c38f5865ac> <https://schema.org/name> "The Sri Lanka National Herbarium, Peradeniya" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60761bb7-ebc6-4d85-87ef-38c38f5865ac> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "PDA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60761bb7-ebc6-4d85-87ef-38c38f5865ac> <https://schema.org/description> "National Herbarium is the major national institution responsible for authentication of plants of Sri Lanka. The National Herbarium is actively involved in plant exploration, and taxonomic investigation of the flora of Sri Lanka. It is the major plant repository currently containing around 160,000 dried plant specimens of Angiosperms, Gymnosperms, Ferns, Bryophytes, Lichens and Algae including 450 type specimens. Some of these specimens are nearly 180 years old and carry valuable historical information. The Herbarium contains over 450 “type specimens” – originally used specimens when describing the species, some are older than 150 years." .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60761bb7-ebc6-4d85-87ef-38c38f5865ac> <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/P625> "POINT(80.584099 7.2622)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> .

<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/60b6101f-e949-420f-a408-0a8884256ab4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://schema.org/Organization> .
