<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/a479792b-55e2-49dd-a10d-37dc6517017d> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Oct 2010. We are interested in buidling a collection of the bryophyte and alga flora or Morocco. The major part of the specimen collection was done in collaboration with the national and international herbaria of Rabat, Morocco; Royal Botanic Garden, Madrid, Spain; University of Salamanca Herbarium; and the University of Reading Herbarium. Mostly vascular plants from various Moroccan regions, with the flora of High Atlas Mountains dominating. There is also an important collection from the South Moroccan desert region." .
