<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/c5a05e04-f4f6-45ac-9dc5-5ed03aca1172> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Jul 2010. MUH is currently set up under the aegis of Deptt. of Botany, Mirpur University of Science & Technology (MUST) at Bhimber Campus, District Bhimber (AK) Pakistan.; ; Botanical Library is available to researchers, students, amateur botanists and horticulturists. Albeit library is at infantile stage yet is it has enough national and international books, articles, journals and monograph reprints.; ; MUH has 3000 Seed Germ (SG) plasm (36 families) collection of wild plants of Shiwalik Mountainous Range of Azad Kashmir and Pakistan.; ; MUH has plenty of photographs, botanical art and artifacts on vegetation of the area depicting its conservation status. Plants and fungi of Pakistan, especially vascular plants of the Shiwalik Range, Azad Kashmir. Plants (Bryohytes; Pteridophytes; Gymnosperms and Angiosperms)" .
