<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/d4edf85c-079d-4122-b2bd-86273ea78110> <https://schema.org/description> "The Center of Excellence in Fungal Research, CEFR, has the following missions: 1. Conducting research in areas of fungal diversity, function and global change, taxonomy, phylogeny and evolution of fungi, plant pathology and endophytes, mushroom cultivation, chemical discovery from fungi, and community service; 2. Housing a regional culture collection and herbarium for Thailand; 3. Developing allied research in mushroom products and agricultural products using unique cultures; 4. Training new mycologists in term of taxonomy and phylogeny of fungi, mushroom science, agricultural use from fungi; 5. Providing valuable workshops for regional participants. Thailand fungi and vascular plants." .
