<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/03718b4a-fd5c-4361-be76-129e592eb87b> <https://schema.org/name> "Instituto de Investigaciones de la Amazonia Peruana" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/03718b4a-fd5c-4361-be76-129e592eb87b> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "HH" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/03718b4a-fd5c-4361-be76-129e592eb87b> <https://schema.org/description> "Entered Dec 2011. A digital version of the collection is stored at ATRIUM website including photographs of the specimens (http://atrium.andesamazon.org/research_project_display_info.php?id=21). The living collection that includes the arboretum and several permanent plots on different forest types is ideal for collecting leaf material for molecular studies. Individuals with diameter ?10 cm are tagged and located in a map. The Jenaro Herrera Research Centre where the herbarium and living collections are located has infrastructure for research (http://www.iiap.org.pe/jenaro.htm). The herbarium contains a well-sampled flora of woody vascular plants of Jenaro Herrera, including species of different forest types such as terra firme forest, white sand forest and seasonally and permanent flooded forest." .
