<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/1684e003-2948-40cc-a117-05d57fdc4de5> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated Jun 2012. The INB Herbarium collections (Fungi and Plants) and our staff are being relocated in a new building, at the same INBio facilities in Heredia, Costa Rica. For this reason we are not currently available to receive visitors or deliver loan requests untill the end of august, 2012.; ; Any visit to our facilities must be scheduled for September 2012 or later. Loan requests will be delivered after this date.; ; Visits or loan requests must be sent to the address and/or e-mail below:; ; INB Herbarium; Instituto Nacional de Biodiversidad INBio P.O. Box 22-3100 Santo Domingo, Heredia Costa Rica; Tel: 2507-8241 / Fax: 2507-8274; ; INB Facilities for visitors. A collection of Apocynaceae type photographs is available. Other web addresses: http://darnis.inbio.ac.cr/ubis/; http://www.inbio.ac.cr/tipos/herbario/tipos.html/; http://www.inbio.ac.cr/bims/PLANTAE.html. Costa Rica; neotropical Apocynaceae." .
