<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/20ae270e-48d1-45db-b364-b48a1d761b0b> <https://schema.org/alternateName> "HCOA" .
<https://scientific-collections.gbif.org/institution/20ae270e-48d1-45db-b364-b48a1d761b0b> <https://schema.org/description> "Updated October 2017. The herbarium contains 11,354 vascular plants, 708 algae, 186 Marchantiophytes; 1,468 lichens, 1,332 mosses and 691 fungi. Vascular flora of coastal Maine and Acadia National Park; basidiomycetes of coastal Maine." .
